WEBVTT

00:12:59.583 --> 00:13:01.958
and the innovation that came before them.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.268
Who knows,

00:13:04.292 --> 00:13:06.601
maybe even some of you
listening to this talk,

00:13:06.625 --> 00:13:08.684
perhaps even on your mobile device,

00:13:08.708 --> 00:13:11.143
will decide that you too
want to play sidekick

00:13:11.167 --> 00:13:12.476
to Captain Chemistry,

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:16.309
the true hero of electronic devices.

00:13:16.333 --> 00:13:17.934
Thank you for your attention,

00:13:17.958 --> 00:13:19.559
and thank you chemistry.

00:13:19.583 --> 00:13:22.833
(Applause)